{
  "subject": "Welcome to Oxy",
  "text": "Hi __OXY_WELCOME_NAME__,\n\nWelcome to Oxy. Your new account gives you access to Oxy apps and services. Here are a few ways to get started.\n\nYour email address: __OXY_WELCOME_ADDRESS__\n\nYour inbox, ready for you\nKeep your mail organised with labels and bundles. Snooze messages for later and pin the ones that matter.\nOpen Inbox: https://inbox.oxy.so\n\nOne account, more from Oxy\nDiscover Oxy apps and services, and use your Oxy account to make yourself at home.\nExplore Oxy: https://oxy.so\n\nMake your account yours\nReview your personal information, privacy and security settings in your Oxy account.\nManage your account: https://accounts.oxy.so\n\nFind answers\nVisit the Oxy Help Center to learn more about your account and get started.\nVisit the Help Center: https://oxy.so/help\n\nThe Oxy Team\n\nYou received this email because your Oxy Inbox was created.",
  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Welcome to Oxy</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { color-scheme:light dark; supported-color-schemes:light dark; }\n    @media only screen and (max-width:540px) {\n      .oxy-padding { padding:28px 20px !important; }\n      .oxy-outer { padding:20px 12px !important; }\n    }\n    @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark) {\n      .oxy-body { background-color:#1f031d !important; color:#fee7ff !important; }\n      .oxy-card { background-color:#4b2947 !important; border-color:#66486d !important; color:#fee7ff !important; }\n      .oxy-heading { color:#fee7ff !important; }\n      .oxy-muted { color:#e0bae6 !important; }\n      .oxy-brand { color:#ec86ff !important; }\n      .oxy-button { background-color:#ec86ff !important; border-color:#ec86ff !important; color:#000000 !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"oxy-body\" bgcolor=\"#f7ebf0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f7ebf0;color:#2a1132;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Your Oxy account is ready. Discover your inbox, apps and account settings.</div>\n  <table class=\"oxy-body\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f7ebf0\" style=\"background-color:#f7ebf0;\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-outer\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 16px;\">\n      <!--[if mso]><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"520\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td><![endif]-->\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:520px;table-layout:fixed;\">\n        <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 24px;\">\n          <a class=\"oxy-brand\" href=\"https://oxy.so\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#9422ae;text-decoration:none;\">Oxy</a>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <h1 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 20px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">Hi __OXY_WELCOME_NAME__,</h1>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 20px;\">Welcome to Oxy. Your new account gives you access to Oxy apps and services. Here are a few ways to get started.</p>\n          <p class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#2a1132;margin:0;\">Your email address<br><strong style=\"overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;\">__OXY_WELCOME_ADDRESS__</strong></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">Your inbox, ready for you</h2>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Keep your mail organised with labels and bundles. Snooze messages for later and pin the ones that matter.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://inbox.oxy.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Open Inbox</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">One account, more from Oxy</h2>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Discover Oxy apps and services, and use your Oxy account to make yourself at home.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://oxy.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Explore Oxy</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">Make your account yours</h2>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Review your personal information, privacy and security settings in your Oxy account.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://accounts.oxy.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Manage your account</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"oxy-card oxy-padding\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#fff7f9\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #c9a5cf;border-radius:16px;background-color:#fff7f9;color:#2a1132;\">\n    <h2 class=\"oxy-heading\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#2a1132;margin:0 0 16px;\">Find answers</h2>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0 0 24px;\">Visit the Oxy Help Center to learn more about your account and get started.</p>\n          <table role=\"presentation\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tr><td class=\"oxy-button\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#9422ae\" style=\"background-color:#9422ae;border-radius:9999px;mso-padding-alt:12px 24px;\">\n      <a class=\"oxy-button\" href=\"https://oxy.so/help\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border:1px solid #9422ae;border-radius:9999px;background-color:#9422ae;color:#ffeefc;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;\">Visit the Help Center</a>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"height:20px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 20px 20px;\">\n          <p class=\"oxy-brand\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;font-weight:600;color:#9422ae;margin:0 0 12px;\">Oxy</p>\n          <p class=\"oxy-muted\" style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:400;color:#593c60;margin:0;\">You received this email because your Oxy Inbox was created.</p>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n      <!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>"
}
